# Snap Load Digital - Payment Routing
#
# Stripe Payment Links (shortcuts to checkout):
#   /deposit  -> Stripe deposit payment link
#   /final    -> Stripe final payment link
#   /annual   -> Stripe annual payment link
#
# Configure each Stripe Payment Link success URL to:
#   https://snaploaddigital.com/payment/success?session_id={CHECKOUT_SESSION_ID}
#
# The success page reads the session_id, looks up the customer name, and displays:
#   "Thank You, [First Name]!"

/deposit              https://stripe.com       302
/final                https://stripe.com       302
/annual               https://stripe.com       302

# Payment success page (preserves query string for session_id / name)
/payment/success      /success.html            200
/success              /success.html            200
